{'symbol': 'LYB', 'date': '2021-12-13 06:45:00', 'title': 'LYONDELLBASELL APPOINTS PETER VANACKER AS CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER', 'text': 'KENNETH LANE, EXECUTIVE VICE PRESIDENT, GLOBAL OLEFINS & POLYOLEFINS, WILL SERVE AS INTERIM CEO DURING TRANSITION PERIOD HOUSTON AND LONDON, DEC. 13, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- LYONDELLBASELL (NYSE: LYB) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS HAS APPOINTED PETER VANACKER, PRESIDENT AND CEO OF NESTE CORPORATION, AS ITS NEW CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER. MR. VANACKER SUCCEEDS BHAVESH V.'}